sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant MobileApp as "Mobile Client"
  participant API
  participant Auth
  participant DB
  participant Analytics as "Analytics Microservice"
  participant FCM as "Firebase Cloud Messaging"

  User->>MobileApp: Enters workout data
  MobileApp->>API: POST /workouts with workout data
  API->>Auth: Validate user token
  Auth-->>API: Token valid
  API->>DB: Insert workout record
  DB-->>API: Confirm insertion
  API->>Analytics: Trigger analysis for meal plan
  Analytics->>DB: Query user's workouts and goals
  DB-->>Analytics: Provide data
  Analytics-->>API: Return meal plan recommendations
  API->>DB: Store meal recommendations
  API-->>MobileApp: Return success + meal recommendations
  Note over API,MobileApp: Periodically
  API->>FCM: Send notifications/reminders
  FCM-->>MobileApp: Push notifications
  MobileApp-->>User: Display notifications and updated data